<!-- Hero about IUBAT -->
<div class="hero-section position-relative overflow-hidden" style="padding:0; border-left:4px solid #b1040e;">
    <div class="row g-0 align-items-stretch">
        <div class="col-lg-7 p-4 p-lg-5 d-flex flex-column justify-content-center">
            <span class="hero-badge">IUBAT — Since 1991 • First Non-Government University in Bangladesh</span>
            <h1>About <span class="accent">IUBAT</span> &amp; This System</h1>
            <p class="lead mb-3" style="max-width:100%;">
                International University of Business Agriculture and Technology — founded in 1991 by Prof. Dr. M Alimullah Miyan.
                Located at 4 Embankment Drive Road, Sector-10, Uttara Model Town, Dhaka-1230, IUBAT is known for its green permanent campus
                and commitment to quality education in Business, Engineering, Computer Science, Agriculture and Health Sciences.
            </p>
            <div class="d-flex flex-wrap gap-2">
                <a href="https://iubat.edu" target="_blank" class="btn btn-primary-custom"><i class="fas fa-up-right-from-square"></i> Visit iubat.edu</a>
                <a href="https://www.facebook.com/IUBAT" target="_blank" class="btn btn-outline-custom">Facebook</a>
                <a href="https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCj0l541NI9bgnufJu-EHfcw" target="_blank" class="btn btn-outline-custom">YouTube</a>
                <a href="https://x.com/IUBAT_BD" target="_blank" class="btn btn-outline-custom">X / Twitter</a>
            </div>
        </div>
        <div class="col-lg-5 d-none d-lg-block position-relative" style="min-height:340px; background: url('/images/home-slider-iubat.jpg') center/cover no-repeat;">
            <div style="position:absolute; inset:0; background: linear-gradient(90deg, rgba(255,255,255,1) 0%, rgba(255,255,255,0.0) 35%, rgba(8,44,102,0.08) 100%);"></div>
            <div style="position:absolute; bottom:12px; right:12px; background:rgba(0,0,0,0.65); color:#fff; font-size:11px; padding:4px 8px; border-radius:2px;">IUBAT Permanent Campus — Uttara, Dhaka</div>
        </div>
    </div>
    <div class="d-lg-none" style="height:180px; background: url('/images/home-slider-iubat.jpg') center/cover no-repeat; border-top:1px solid var(--sust-border);"></div>
</div>

<div class="row g-4 mb-4">
    <div class="col-lg-8">
        <div class="detail-card h-100">
            <div class="detail-header">
                <h5><i class="fas fa-building-columns" style="margin-right:8px; color:#fff;"></i> About IUBAT</h5>
                <span class="badge" style="background:#fff; color:var(--sust-navy); font-size:11px; padding:4px 8px; border-radius:2px;">EST. 1991</span>
            </div>
            <div class="detail-body">
                <p style="font-size:13.5px; line-height:23px; color:var(--sust-text);">
                    <strong>International University of Business Agriculture and Technology (IUBAT)</strong> — established in 1991 — is the first non-government university in Bangladesh.
                    Founded by the renowned educator <strong>Prof. Dr. M Alimullah Miyan</strong>, IUBAT pioneered private higher education in the country with a vision
                    to provide world-class education, research and innovation.
                </p>
                <p style="font-size:13.5px; line-height:23px; color:var(--sust-text);">
                    The university operates from its <strong>permanent green campus</strong> at Uttara (4 Embankment Drive Road, off Dhaka-Ashulia Road, Sector-10)
                    spread across 20+ acres, featuring modern labs, library, auditoriums and hostels. IUBAT offers undergraduate and graduate programs
                    through its colleges of Business Administration, Engineering, Computer Science & Engineering (CSE), Agriculture, Environmental Science, Nursing and Tourism & Hospitality.
                </p>
                <div class="row g-3 mt-1">
                    <div class="col-md-6">
                        <div style="background:var(--sust-bg-gray); border:1px solid var(--sust-border); border-radius:4px; padding:12px;">
                            <h6 class="fw-bold mb-1" style="color:var(--sust-navy); font-size:13px;"><i class="fas fa-award" style="color:var(--sust-red); margin-right:6px;"></i> Rankings &amp; Recognition</h6>
                            <p class="mb-0" style="font-size:12.5px; color:var(--sust-muted);">QS World Ranking 2025 (1401), WURI 2024 — Top 300 Innovative Universities (109th globally), Times Higher Education Impact Ranking participant.</p>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                    <div class="col-md-6">
                        <div style="background:var(--sust-red-soft); border:1px solid var(--sust-red-border); border-radius:4px; padding:12px;">
                            <h6 class="fw-bold mb-1" style="color:var(--sust-red-dark); font-size:13px;"><i class="fas fa-location-dot" style="margin-right:6px;"></i> Campus</h6>
                            <p class="mb-0" style="font-size:12.5px; color:var(--sust-muted);">4 Embankment Drive Road, Sector-10, Uttara Model Town, Dhaka-1230<br />Phone: +88-02-55091871 • info@iubat.edu • <a href="https://iubat.edu" target="_blank" style="color:var(--sust-red); font-weight:600;">iubat.edu</a></p>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                </div>
                <hr style="border-top:1px solid var(--sust-border-light); margin:16px 0;" />
                <h6 class="fw-bold mb-2" style="color:var(--sust-navy); font-size:14px;"><i class="fas fa-file-circle-check" style="color:var(--sust-red); margin-right:6px;"></i> About This Student Service System</h6>
                <p style="font-size:13.5px; line-height:23px; color:var(--sust-text);">
                    This <strong>IUBAT Student Service Request System</strong> was developed as an academic prototype using <strong>ASP.NET Core MVC (.NET 10)</strong>
                    to digitize manual service requests (ID Card Replacement, Transcript Request, Certificate Request). Students can register, submit requests,
                    track status (<span class="status-badge status-pending" style="vertical-align:middle;">Pending</span> → <span class="status-badge status-processing">Processing</span> → <span class="status-badge status-completed">Completed</span> / <span class="status-badge status-rejected">Rejected</span>)
                    and view details; authorized staff can manage all requests and update status. Built with Identity + Entity Framework Core (Neon Postgres) and hosted on Render (Docker) — simple, secure and responsive.
                </p>
                <div class="d-flex flex-wrap gap-2 mt-2">
                    <span style="background:var(--sust-navy-soft); border:1px solid #d0dbea; color:var(--sust-navy); padding:5px 10px; border-radius:2px; font-size:12px; font-weight:600;">ASP.NET MVC</span>
                    <span style="background:var(--sust-red-soft); border:1px solid var(--sust-red-border); color:var(--sust-red-dark); padding:5px 10px; border-radius:2px; font-size:12px; font-weight:600;">EF Core + Neon Postgres</span>
                    <span style="background:#e6f4ea; border:1px solid #b7e1c1; color:#0d4a1a; padding:5px 10px; border-radius:2px; font-size:12px; font-weight:600;">Render Docker</span>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>
    <div class="col-lg-4">
